                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd664c12-c65d-3ca8-af99-32ffd679128c",
                        "entry_id": "8818888d-8647-3820-bb2a-4127cbb4494b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "copper-red"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d124dad1-13d5-4712-95ee-93b8f98ad0af",
                                "sense_id": "cd664c12-c65d-3ca8-af99-32ffd679128c",
                                "text": "Огро́мный, кру́глый, мѐдно-кра́сный ме́сяц гляде́л пря́мо в о́кна. «Э́то от ме́сяца така́я тишина́, — поду́мал Раско́льников, — он, ве́рно, тепе́рь зага́дку зага́дывает».",
                                "translation": "A huge, round, copper-red moon looked in at the windows. \"It's the moon that makes it so still, weaving some mystery,\" thought Raskolnikov.",
                                "english": "A huge, round, copper-red moon looked in at the windows. \"It's the moon that makes it so still, weaving some mystery,\" thought Raskolnikov."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
